  (text "U7 TPS7A0230PDBVR = 3.0V 200mA LDO from SYS = THE 3.0V rail \"VDD\" of the whole board, ALWAYS ON\ncircuit = DS p26 fig 8-4. EN tied to IN @ DS p19 so firmware can NOT switch it: sensors sleep by command\nONE rail so no 3.0V pin can stand above the MCU's VDD + 0.3V @ PS p972\nC46 1u on IN = \"1uF or greater\" @ DS p27\nNO output cap of its own: OUT wants >= 0.5uF effective, <= 22uF derated @ DS p5 and the rail\nalready has 23.5u nominal = 13.1 to 20.8u derated (calc) -> C6 = 1u, NOT Nordic's 4.7u\n+-1.5% @ DS p6 = a row for IN >= 3.5V, from dropout up to there NO accuracy row\npower up follows SYS, ramp = NOT stated -> IMU soft reset (README F3)\nNEVER let the charger pull SYS down: the rail drains BACK through U7 @ DS p19 (README F1)\nlayout: one of the rail's 1u AT the OUT pin @ DS p3, short wide path to W1/Y2"
    (at 100.33 13.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a6e6ee7e-67c0-4962-82a5-e6d321f3441b")
  )
  (text "ICM-45686 = 6-axis IMU @ SPI 4 wire, 4MHz MAX (BUSES note). circuit = DS p34 fig 10\nVDD + VDDIO on the 3.0V rail, allowed 1.71 to 3.6V / 1.08 to 3.6V @ DS p20\nC36 + C37 100n = \"X7R 0.1uF 10%\", one per pin @ DS p34 table 11\nsupply must rise in 0.01 to 1ms @ DS p21, here = NOT stated\n-> firmware MUST soft reset it after every boot (README F3)\nINT1 resets open drain active low @ DS p76 -> firmware sets push pull first (README IMU)\nCLKIN from the TCXO, 20-40kHz ok @ DS p37. ODR = setting x 1.024 @ AN-000478 p44\nfirmware MUST disable the pin 9 pullup BEFORE selecting CLKIN @ DS p28 + p29 (README F3)\nnever switched off: sleep by command = 2.2uA typ at 1.8V @ DS p20\nRESV pins 2/3/7/10/11 open @ DS p27"
    (at 165.1 48.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "5c2aea15-1986-451e-a637-d4ea9b5091ce")
  )
  (text "MMC5983MA = 3-axis magnetometer @ I2C 0x30 (DS p9), 100kHz (BUSES note)\ncircuit = DS p10 \"I2C single supply\": VDD, VDDIO, SPI_CS + pullups on ONE node = the 3.0V rail\nrail = 2.955 to 3.045V (calc), allowed 2.8 to 3.6V @ DS p2\nC38 1u on VDD @ DS p10. C39 + C43 10u each on CAP: \"minimum 10uF\" for SET/RESET @ DS p11\nTWO as one 10u 0603 keeps only 6.5u at 3.0V (calc). effective or nominal = NOT stated\nCAP = VDD inside the chip @ DS p11 -> C39 + C43 are also U7's output caps (U7 note)\nR9/R19 10k (MCU sheet) = the value for buses under 5cm @ DS p12\nsupply rise must be <= 5.0ms @ DS p2, here = NOT stated\nfirmware: wait 10ms after power up @ DS p15 (README F3). never off: power down = 1uA @ DS p2\nlayout: no current traces under or opposite the sensor, away from inductors + cell @ DS p12"
    (at 144.78 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "77cd2a05-5a39-4b85-9174-8e22327a47df")
  )
